@host = http://localhost:5080
@apiKey = dev-local-key

### Supported countries
GET {{host}}/api/v1/countries
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Country profile
GET {{host}}/api/v1/countries/TR
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Holidays for a year
GET {{host}}/api/v1/holidays/TR/2026
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Holidays for a month
GET {{host}}/api/v1/holidays/TR/2026/4
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Holidays in a date range
GET {{host}}/api/v1/holidays/TR/range?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-06-30
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Next five holidays
GET {{host}}/api/v1/holidays/TR/next?count=5
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Upcoming holidays in the next 60 days
GET {{host}}/api/v1/holidays/TR/upcoming?days=60
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Long weekends
GET {{host}}/api/v1/holidays/TR/long-weekends/2026
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Holiday statistics
GET {{host}}/api/v1/holidays/TR/statistics/2026
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Is this date a holiday?
GET {{host}}/api/v1/holidays/TR/check?date=2026-04-23
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Upcoming holidays worldwide
GET {{host}}/api/v1/holidays/worldwide/upcoming
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Workday breakdown of a range
GET {{host}}/api/v1/workdays/TR/count?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-03-31
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Add ten business days
GET {{host}}/api/v1/workdays/TR/shift?startDate=2026-04-20&workdays=10
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Is this date a workday?
GET {{host}}/api/v1/workdays/TR/status?date=2026-04-23
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Unauthorised request (expect 401)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/holidays/TR/2026
